| R1 | `etude gate` rejects a supplied artifact whose SHA-256 differs from the latest captured output for the stage's produced role, before any check, seat invocation, artifact materialization by the engine, or run-ref write. | Engine test: mismatch returns error, zero check and seat invocations, run ref commit unchanged. Fresh-binary CLI reproduction of A01 fails closed. |
